sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Main / Settings Vision
  participant Hook as useVisionLiveFeed
  participant Socket as visionService singleton
  participant Remote as External Vision server (unverified producer)
  participant API as Local Express API
  UI->>API: GET /api/machine/init-status (250 ms when hook mounted)
  API-->>UI: Machine snapshot / panel / lastVisionCanvas metadata
  UI->>Hook: Enable preview with programId
  Hook->>Socket: connectVisionSocket
  Socket->>Remote: Socket.IO /socket.io/ websocket, optional remoteKey
  Remote-->>Socket: connect
  Socket-->>Hook: onConnect
  Hook->>Socket: subscribeLiveFeed
  Socket->>Remote: subscribe_live_feed {programId, fps:10}
  Remote-->>Socket: live_frame or frame_data (client expectation)
  Socket-->>Hook: image string and metadata
  Hook-->>UI: frame and statistics state
  UI->>Hook: disable / unmount
  Hook->>Socket: unsubscribeLiveFeed / disconnectVisionSocket
  Socket->>Remote: unsubscribe_live_feed / disconnect
  Note over Remote: Server implementation outside inspected source
  Note over UI,API: Physical capture/register counters use HTTP polling, not Socket.IO
  %% Evidence: frontend/src/hooks/useMachineInitialization.ts:L212-L227; frontend/src/hooks/useVisionLiveFeed.ts:L24-L92; frontend/src/services/visionService.ts:L629-L689.
